  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> &hellip;.(1)<br /><math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Multiplying by <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;on both sides, we get<br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(using (1))<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>"
